        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-06-01T16:08:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I've typically played with two friends and normally one of us will play two heroes. &nbsp;Four heroes seems to be a good balance for a majority of games. &nbsp;In the case of V5 villians it seems to be rough no matter how many heroes/villians you play of it. &nbsp;Though in V5 it always seems best to take out Ermine first if she is part of it as her deck manipulation is more difficult to deal with as the turns go by.&nbsp;</p>",
